        -752,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 704,
        "height": 608,
        "content": "## Chase unpaid invoices automatically with escalating AI reminders\n\n### How it works\nChasing payment is the job nobody wants and the one that quietly costs the most. Every morning this template reads your unpaid invoices from Google Sheets and a Code node works out how many days each one is overdue and when it was last chased - so nobody gets emailed twice in a week. A Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini then writes a reminder whose tone matches the stage: a warm nudge under a week, a firm request for a payment date after a week, and a serious final notice past 30 days. Each stage sends its own email, final notices also alert the finance channel in Slack, and every invoice row is stamped with the date and stage so the sequence continues correctly tomorrow.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect Google Sheets, Google Gemini (PaLM) API, Gmail and Slack.\n2. Give your Invoices sheet columns: Invoice No, Client, Contact Email, Amount, Due Date, Status, Last Reminder.\n3. Mark paid invoices as anything other than Unpaid and they are skipped automatically.\n\n### Customization tips\nChange the day thresholds, or attach the original invoice PDF from Drive."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
